# The app image's build context: only what deploy/Dockerfile copies. The data comes from the data
# image (deploy/data.Dockerfile, with its own ignore file), so data/ stays out entirely.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/server/package.json
!apps/server/src/**
!apps/web/**
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
!packages/shared/**
# The /schema page draws its diagrams from this doc (apps/web/src/lib/doc-diagrams.ts).
!docs/upstream-vs-derived.md
packages/shared/node_modules
